  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Jun Shen Guang asks what to do about Flickering Light grotto-heaven. Qin Ding Ling is told that the grotto-heaven is led by Gu Immortal Liang Jing Jing, and that unlike Old Immortal Hua Yu they do not know much about her or her true intentions.",
      "chapters": [
        2270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "loc_flickering_light_grotto_heaven",
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_old_immortal_hua_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the fusion of the two heavens reaches its most intense moment, Flickering Light grotto-heaven is exposed as a heaven vein node. Inside, Liang Jing Jing trembles in fear and quickly asks Fang Yuan for help. She offers to contribute light heaven for a large amount of contribution points in exchange for the alliance leader saving Flickering Light grotto-heaven. Fang Yuan decides he cannot save it and abandons the grotto-heaven. She hides in light heaven, cries for help, and later curses him for leaving them to die.",
      "chapters": [
        2271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-assault",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling and Jun Shen Guang arrive to find Spectral Soul Demon Venerable rampaging inside Flickering Light grotto-heaven. Light path Gu Immortal Liang Jing Jing, rank eight, is covered in heavy injuries and flies away in tears while other Gu Immortals use their lives to defend her. With Qin Ding Ling and Jun Shen Guang’s help, the survivors escape. Only three Gu Immortals from Flickering Light grotto-heaven remain, one unconscious and two heavily injured.",
      "chapters": [
        2272
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "escape-and-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "path_light"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liang Jing Jing bows and pays respects, saying she will never forget the debt of saving their lives and praising Heavenly Court over Fang Yuan’s Great Love claim. Despite injuries, she decides to go with Qin Ding Ling to help convince Old Immortal Hua Yu at Profound Literature grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        2272
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "escape-and-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    }
  ],
